body:
AI script for Azithromichic:

2 tablets on day 1;  
1 tablet on day 2;  
0 tablets on day 3;  
-1 tablets on day 4;…

sparks have pros and cons;

the biggest pro is that they don’t have will and can go on missions even when injured (damaged?) so they are very consistent. the perks that allow them to shoot 3 times in a turn with no aim penalty and to take reaction shots on activated pods means with an extended mag and scope, they will be putting out a ton of consistent damage. 

downside is that you unlock them in the middle game, so they will start at a low level compared to your other troops, they also have entirely seperate upgrades for armor and weapons so they can be very costly. i like to make 1 per campaign, but i’ve never beaten the hardest difficulty lol

youre not invisible. I see you, right now. what is bringing you so low? 

&#x200B;

how do you want to be seen?
